{
  "id": "1191",
  "title": "In a Predicament",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2021-03-24",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming doesn’t answer quite as the teacher expected.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1191/3004e3a50a197ed8f4108a906348ccf4d932dde1.mp3?1612529336",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "左右为难\n\n老师：小明，请用“左右为难”来造一个句子。\n小明：我考试时左右为难。\n老师：是题目不会写，让你左右为难吗？\n小明：不是，是因为左边和右边的同学写得都不一样，我不知道要看左边还是要看右边，让我左右为难。",
    "traditional": "左右為難\n\n老師：小明，請用“左右為難”來造一個句子。\n小明：我考試時左右為難。\n老師：是題目不會寫，讓你左右為難嗎？\n小明：不是，是因為左邊和右邊的同學寫得都不一樣，我不知道要看左邊還是要看右邊，讓我左右為難。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In a Predicament"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "老师：小明，请用“左右为难”来造一个句子。",
      "traditional": "老師：小明，請用“左右為難”來造一個句子。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī xiǎo míng qǐng yòng zuǒ yòu wéi nán lái zào yí ge jù zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: Little Ming, please use “in a predicament” in a sentence."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明：我考试时左右为难。",
      "traditional": "小明：我考試時左右為難。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wǒ kǎo shì shí zuǒ yòu wéi nán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: I’m “in a predicament” during tests."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "老师：是题目不会写，让你左右为难吗？",
      "traditional": "老師：是題目不會寫，讓你左右為難嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī shì tí mù bú huì xiě ràng nǐ zuǒ yòu wéi nán ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: Is it because you don’t know the answers to the questions, so you’re in a predicament?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明：不是，是因为左边和右边的同学写得都不一样，",
      "traditional": "小明：不是，是因為左邊和右邊的同學寫得都不一樣，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bú shì shì yīn wèi zuǒ bian hé yòu bian de tóng xué xiě de dōu bù yí yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "我不知道要看左边还是要看右边，让我左右为难。",
      "traditional": "我不知道要看左邊還是要看右邊，讓我左右為難。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ bù zhī dào yào kàn zuǒ bian hái shi yào kàn yòu bian ràng wǒ zuǒ yòu wéi nán",
      "english": "Little Ming: No, it’s because my classmate to the left writes different answers than my classmate on the right."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I don’t know whether to look to my left or to my right, so I’m “in a predicament”."
    }
  ],
